If PITR remains limited, do not make unrelated enterprise gate fail.

But report it correctly.

================================================================
134. EVIDENCE TIERS
===================

Introduce explicit evidence levels:

```text
E0 = implementation only
E1 = unit tested
E2 = integration tested
E3 = multi-process/system tested
E4 = live external-system tested
E5 = production observed
```

Every major capability should state evidence tier.

Do not label E1 as production-proven.

================================================================
135. REQUIRED POSTGRESQL TESTS
==============================

Use real PostgreSQL for:

RLS
role privilege
pool isolation
quota race
cross-tenant queries
migration ownership
backup/restore tenant isolation

SQLite tests cannot prove PostgreSQL RLS behavior.

================================================================
136. REQUIRED END-TO-END TENANT TEST
====================================

Create:

Organization A
Organization B

Each has:

user
project
repository
job
usage
audit entry
API key

Authenticate as A.

Attempt access to every B resource class.

Expected:

ZERO cross-tenant data exposure
ZERO cross-tenant mutation

Repeat in:

API
store/service
background worker
realtime stream

================================================================
137. REQUIRED SCIM E2E TEST
===========================

Organization A SCIM client:

provision user
create/update group
assign membership
deactivate user

Verify:

authorization changes
audit
historical ownership retained

Then prove credential cannot affect Organization B.

================================================================
138. REQUIRED QUOTA E2E TEST
============================

Create hard organization budget.

Run concurrent submissions.

Prove:

reservation/enforcement
usage settlement
warning events
hard-limit behavior
no silent reset across retries

================================================================
139. REQUIRED AUDIT E2E TEST
============================

Perform:

login
API-key creation
job create
approval
policy update
SCIM deactivation

Export audit.

Verify:

actor
tenant
action
resource
result
timestamps
schema version

Secrets must not appear.

================================================================
140. REQUIRED PACKAGE / DEPLOYMENT TEST
=======================================

Existing:

wheel
container
Compose
Kubernetes

must continue to function with enterprise schema/configuration.

Do not break local SQLite mode.

================================================================
141. LOCAL MODE COMPATIBILITY
=============================

Local user should still be able to run:

```bash
zcoder run "Fix tests"
```

without:

organization provisioning
SCIM
enterprise PostgreSQL

Use an implicit local tenant/context internally if needed.

Do not scatter special cases throughout business logic.

================================================================
142. LOCAL TENANT
=================

If implementing implicit local organization:

give it deterministic semantics.

Never let it accidentally be used in production mode.

================================================================
143. PRODUCTION MODE FAIL-CLOSED
================================

Production SaaS mode must require:

PostgreSQL
tenant-aware authentication
secure secret configuration
explicit organization context

Do not silently fall back to local/default organization.

================================================================
144. OBSERVABILITY UPDATE
=========================

Measure:

tenant auth failures
RLS denials where safely observable
quota denials
SCIM operations
API-key authentication
policy denials
audit export backlog

Avoid raw organization IDs as unrestricted high-cardinality metrics.

================================================================
145. BILLING OBSERVABILITY
==========================

Monitor:

usage ingest lag
aggregation delay
duplicate rejection
quota reservation failures
ledger reconciliation

Do not log billable prompt/source content.

================================================================
