================================================================
149. VERSION DECISION
=====================

At the end, determine version from:

actual published history
public API compatibility
CLI compatibility
database migration compatibility
enterprise feature scope

Do not automatically keep:

1.40.0

and do not automatically choose:

2.0.0

Explain evidence-based SemVer decision.

================================================================
150. FINAL REQUIRED COMMANDS
============================

Run:

```bash
python -m pytest -q
python main.py --help
python main.py --version
python -m build
git diff --check
git status --short
```

Also separately run:

```text
real PostgreSQL suite
RLS suite
cross-tenant suite
quota concurrency suite
SCIM suite
identity suite
backup/restore tenant suite
package clean-install
container smoke
release gate
```

Run available:

```bash
ruff check .
black --check .
mypy .
```

Do not hide failed or skipped commands.

================================================================
151. DEFINITION OF DONE
=======================

Upgrade-10 is complete only when:

* [ ] Upgrade-09 evidence claims are corrected
* [ ] evidence tier exists
* [ ] version strategy is resolved
* [ ] organization domain exists
* [ ] project domain exists
* [ ] every tenant-owned record has enforced scope
* [ ] application-layer tenant isolation exists
* [ ] PostgreSQL RLS exists where selected
* [ ] normal app DB role cannot bypass RLS
* [ ] pool tenant-leak test passes
* [ ] cross-tenant negative matrix passes
* [ ] enterprise RBAC exists
* [ ] policy engine supports scoped decisions
* [ ] OIDC is organization-aware
* [ ] service accounts exist
* [ ] scoped API keys exist
* [ ] keys can be rotated/revoked
* [ ] SCIM Users/Groups boundary works
* [ ] SCIM cross-tenant isolation passes
* [ ] immutable-style usage ledger exists
* [ ] usage deduplication exists
* [ ] quota race test passes
* [ ] billing domain is provider-neutral
* [ ] entitlements are capability-based
* [ ] enterprise audit log exists
* [ ] audit export exists
* [ ] audit export contains no secrets
* [ ] tenant-aware artifact access exists
* [ ] tenant-aware realtime access exists
* [ ] noisy-neighbor protections exist
* [ ] local mode still works
* [ ] production mode cannot fall back to local tenant
* [ ] all P0 cross-tenant tests pass
* [ ] release gate contains real evidence
* [ ] docs reflect implementation
* [ ] no P0/P1 security issue remains

================================================================
